{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":133938,\"title\":\"Management of a Novice Alchemist\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"For a lonely orphan, there is almost only one career path to success. That is to get a national qualification as an alchemist. After graduating from the Royal Alchemist Training Academy, which requires nothing but ability, Sarasa is presented with the rights to a store by her master. After being sent off by her generous mentor, Sarasa sets off on her journey, dreaming of a slightly elegant life as an alchemist, but upon arrival, she is shocked to find that the countryside is even more rural than she had imagined. However, even in such a place, she has to manage a store somehow to make a living.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hFnddzz8MJMrrrCEQGbY1aSCG7M.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/50CUkSThRy6rW3OnxO18C7xM6pu.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":26,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":12,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"AT-X\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2022-12-19\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2870796,\"name\":\"Marina Maki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2935157,\"name\":\"Chihiro Kumano\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2177603,\"name\":\"Yuki Kanezawa\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3392952,\"name\":\"Mizuki Sasaki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3800621,\"name\":\"Shuuji Yoshida\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1148302,\"name\":\"Hideki Tonokatsu\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3575690,\"name\":\"Yuri Hagiwara\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1467473,\"name\":\"Akira Kato\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1433645,\"name\":\"Shigeki Awai\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1695709,\"name\":\"Kanon Takao\",\"character\":\"Sarasa Feed (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w3h6h9R29uRsOv01qbk94ym2msm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1597103,\"name\":\"Hina Kino\",\"character\":\"Lorea (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iwq0VvY3q4MPfn5ZTjsthhNcuyd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1339189,\"name\":\"Saori Onishi\",\"character\":\"Iris Lotze (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg\"},{\"id\":2072870,\"name\":\"Nanaka Suwa\",\"character\":\"Kate Staven (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGuWJn7DPX3alblakB5WZE23LX2.jpg\"},{\"id\":126286,\"name\":\"Mitsuki Saiga\",\"character\":\"Ophelia Millis (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qjRHodCBpKY8nEa4p8dZriDoil4.jpg\"},{\"id\":1220947,\"name\":\"Ami Koshimizu\",\"character\":\"Maria (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"ciwaz7nY5So\",\"name\":\"Management of a Novice Alchemist Official Trailer 2\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ep9rJFLrbX0\",\"name\":\"Management of a Novice Alchemist Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":63576,\"title\":\"Fate/kaleid liner Prisma Illya\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fivwHxH3xddSkSyqonXtuydBpIY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4245901639344262,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":97782,\"title\":\"Kuma Kuma Kuma Bear\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AtjPKOfpW2VcaB37yNoiPDY73iV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42307692307692313,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":247045,\"title\":\"Nyaight of the Living Cat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lF2awNMJIasAZsSy2XzFlYGtzKW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4131868131868132,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":63453,\"title\":\"Garo: The Animation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cl9x83myIZtDSqHPu4WMekKt7E0.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40480000000000005,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":63330,\"title\":\"My Wife is the Student Council President\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tcd7hgNMeK8Fv8TWvtb9uHks4lh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.29432624113475175,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":214547,\"title\":\"My Clueless First Friend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vgUQaunqSLmTtU38VmRntz8aVsN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.290990990990991,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":97617,\"title\":\"The Misfit of Demon King Academy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xBNR7V4s5b0qQfRCiyEvIC5PS6v.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28954802259887,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":283818,\"title\":\"A Star Brighter than the Sun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tMCyjS1Qif5VhmRakSJpF0TzdQj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.283030303030303,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":283880,\"title\":\"Hands off: Sawaranaide Kotesashi-kun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qTlVmoB4lcPcZaxUKF63Hqu2gUg.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27956989247311825,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63322,\"title\":\"Superb Song of the Valkyries: Symphogear\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g0jsgViN4aBybkgTmr4XgZHluxX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2786666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63323,\"title\":\"SHIMONETA: A Boring World Where the Concept of Dirty Jokes Doesn't Exist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eO4z0x1NPO0L6Spke6PHbqkKxFk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27728613569321536,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63495,\"title\":\"SCHOOL-LIVE!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9emJgQBvRrUiTobsbEmArDG7qFF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27644927536231884,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bTsEnSX0epnmC5SDZS3IPsF5C9O.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-10-03\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Got a Shop!\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa, who attends alchemist training school, is approaching the day of her graduation exam. She has studied hard for 5 years, hoping to have a shop like her parents, who passed away. Her hard work finally pays off - but something goes wrong during the exam. If you don't pass, you can't become an alchemist! What are you going to do, Sarasa!?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tNaDJc0L3UNjHeyG7maXrD0i2Vp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-03\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"I've Arrived at the Village!\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa left the royal capital, where she was comfortable, and was familiar, and came to Yoku Village, where her new shop is located. She asks Lorea, the daughter of the grocery store, and Els, her neighbor, to introduce her to the villagers, but she struggles with unfamiliar communication and becomes depressed. Can Sarasa really run a store?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yIRBec8hmbRCcLsRk5HSE5zGcjS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-10\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"A Monster Appears!\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa’s skills come in handy when some gatherers run afoul of a monster, but not everyone understands that in alchemy and finance alike, there must be equivalent exchange.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oLsx5NZh5y3s6gP1oL2snpLgg5j.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-17\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Let's Live Together!\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa needs some assistance running her business after recent excitement left her feeling drained. Luckily she knows exactly who to ask for help!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/88pRmGp3vqZRH7ULGEKfBfIb4XF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-24\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Develop a New Product!\",\"overview\":\"Lorea brings up the idea of putting a refrigerator in the kitchen. Sarasa heads to the cave with Iris, Kate, Andre and others to hunt the \\\"ice-fang bat\\\" that has a cooling material. But her companions didn't know that there is a trap that deals a lot of damage in the cave...\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qjhJ1ca1cjtohuPIgfPPdiun1ed.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-31\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Let's Go to the Lake!\",\"overview\":\"A monster that could drop a rare ingredient, AND Sarasa could enjoy a trip to the lake in the bargain? Sign her up for a monster hunt!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hRGn1gzxJMbfLvTC2E80fh18zRH.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-07\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"My Artifact Broke!\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa’s powers go haywire when her pendant breaks! Running the shop is tough without it, but duty calls — much to her (and her customers’) chagrin.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aM9VizsfKrOxJMmDZGteoEEAF9x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-14\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"A Business Rival Appeared!\",\"overview\":\"It’s normal to have a competitor; it’s just business. But when Sarasa learns her new rival is scheming with bandits? Things just got personal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g7gfqEmhBfCRjYPh5s8mNZd7GpR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-21\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Let's Go Gather Honey!\",\"overview\":\"Iris and Kate have a dept to pay. Sarasa suggests they gather fruitrot bee honey! But this quest isn’t entirely sweet…\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k1q5pXdlsx9XE3Udf9qaCjB4eyX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-28\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Let's Settle Things with Money!\",\"overview\":\"Iris’ father and Kate’s mother stop by for a very specific reason, but Sarasa isn’t convinced they’re telling Iris the whole story. Meanwhile, Elyn has a request for Sarasa.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jR0USRlS07imAVm9NyxuzJ2iMTB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-05\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Let's Defeat a Salamander!\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa has a hunch the salamander slithering around the volcano is to blame for recent events, but there’s a golden opportunity lurking in this precarious situation!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bR1mPncLgGOP1FqIyFV3QDYl9uA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-12\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Management of a Novice Alchemist\",\"overview\":\"Sarasa finally feels like she has a handle on her shop — but then she receives a letter that could set her down a new career path entirely. A final clash will decide it all!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zh38rURlySZNFLbJo7UhRXWFNtA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-19\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-10-03\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}